# Percent stacking

Provisional house rule (also in `AGENTS.md`):

- **Growth / bonuses** (more damage, scrap, credits, XP, …): **additive** — sum percents, apply once vs base (`100 + a + b`).
- **Reductions / less-of** (less heat gain, less damage taken, …): **multiplicative** — chain retain factors so stacks diminish and cannot reach 0 (`×0.8 ×0.8…`). One source must be < 100% reduction.

Do not invent one-off stacking for a new modifier without a strong reason.
